{
  "id": "6aaa4dadc09e4fbc75502e82",
  "title": "ワルプルギスの廻天 感想 (ネタバレ注意)",
  "created": 1789545902,
  "updated": 1789597255,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aaa4dadc09e4fbc75502e82",
      "text": "ワルプルギスの廻天 感想 (ネタバレ注意)",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545902,
      "updated": 1789545902
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4dad00000000009e6b4f",
      "text": "[劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ〈ワルプルギスの廻天〉]の感想とか",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545902,
      "updated": 1789545914
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4db900000000009e6b52",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545914,
      "updated": 1789545914
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4db900000000009e6b53",
      "text": "スマホメモより取り急ぎコピペ[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545915,
      "updated": 1789545953
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4db900000000009e6b54",
      "text": "ほむらから妖艶な表情が消えた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545915,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b55",
      "text": "きゅうべい、前回目が濁っていたが、なんともなかった？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b56",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b57",
      "text": "ほむら、なんだかんだで他の魔法少女のことも考えて動いてた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b58",
      "text": " ツンデレじゃん",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b59",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5a",
      "text": "魔獣討伐",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5b",
      "text": " メガネきゅうべい草",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5c",
      "text": " 赤いひもで結ばれている",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5d",
      "text": "  腰に結んでいる",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5e",
      "text": "  命綱？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b5f",
      "text": "  ほむらの魔力を使っている？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b60",
      "text": "  ほむらの保護下で戦わせている",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b61",
      "text": "   きゅうべいに契約させて戦わせるより安全？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b62",
      "text": " きゅうべいの言い分がすべてブーメランで爆笑",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b63",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b64",
      "text": "ある意味でほむらの行為が裏目にまた出てしまった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b65",
      "text": " 円環の理から引き剥がして異常が起きたことで、抜け道ができた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b66",
      "text": " 踏んだり蹴ったりだ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b67",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b68",
      "text": "最初、名塚とこつねを経て魔女になる",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b69",
      "text": "その後、円環の理ができて使われなくなった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6a",
      "text": "ほむらが円環の理を引き裂いたことで、抜け道ができた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6b",
      "text": "わすとしちょうかは円環の理を元に戻すために現世にやってきた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6c",
      "text": "セルマは円環の理を破壊して魔女化する世界に戻すのが目的",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6e",
      "text": "弓でほむらの射る",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b6f",
      "text": " 悪魔の力を消した？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b70",
      "text": " そのあと変身したままだから違うか",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b71",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b72",
      "text": "錠がかけられたまどかの衣装",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b73",
      "text": " どういうこと？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b74",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b75",
      "text": "最後の意味",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b76",
      "text": " 足跡、やはり離別した？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b77",
      "text": "  一度アルティメットまどかがほむらのほうを向いたが、別方向に行ってしまった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b78",
      "text": " でも、円環の理とまどかは融合しなかったような",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b79",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7a",
      "text": "唇をめくって歯を見せる",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7b",
      "text": "　どういう意味？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7d",
      "text": "壁で囲まれた世界",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7e",
      "text": " みたきはら以外が滅亡した？",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b7f",
      "text": " みんながのぞんだ形でないけれど",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b80",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b81",
      "text": "最後きゅうべいテメェ！！",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4de400000000009e6b82",
      "text": " 絶対続編作る気だよ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545958,
      "updated": 1789545958
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa4db100000000009e6b50",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789545906,
      "updated": 1789545906
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa772800000000003ad4b0",
      "text": "2回見た[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789556522,
      "updated": 1789573861
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa773400000000003ad4b1",
      "text": "改めて感想を書こうとすると、なんだかもう一度見たくなってきてしまった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789556533,
      "updated": 1789556555
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa5f9f0000000000eed16c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550496,
      "updated": 1789550496
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa5f9f0000000000eed16d",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550496,
      "updated": 1789550500
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa5fa40000000000eed16f",
      "text": "　[2026-09-16] 2回目を観た",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550502,
      "updated": 1789573943
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaabb370000000000c6f9a0",
      "text": "　　",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789573944,
      "updated": 1789573944
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaa5fa30000000000eed16e",
      "text": "　さやか「おいほむら、まどかのこと円環の理っていうのやめなよ」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789550500,
      "updated": 1789578269
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaacb920000000000848aed",
      "text": "　？？？「豚のことナポレオンっていうのやめなよ」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789578131,
      "updated": 1789578197
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac6850000000000848ae7",
      "text": "　女神まどか「わたしは、そこにいるよ」",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576839,
      "updated": 1789578227
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac1310000000000848ade",
      "text": "　まどかの手で磔の刑に処された暁美ほむら、（血肉ではなく）お宝画像フォルダの中身が全身から流出してしまう",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789575474,
      "updated": 1789578491
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac4f10000000000848ae3",
      "text": "　　思い出の映像がだいたいモザイクの掛かったピンクと肌色の画像が目立つ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576435,
      "updated": 1789578708
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac58a0000000000848ae4",
      "text": "　　雰囲気的には、暁美ほむらの[脳内メーカー]は過去の鹿目まどかとの思い出で9割くらい、残り1割はまどかを救うためのループで耐え忍んできた精神的苦痛の数々くらいの印象（正確な画像比率はわからへん）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576587,
      "updated": 1789577588
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac3750000000000848ae2",
      "text": "　さやかを[壁ドン]するほむら",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576054,
      "updated": 1789576813
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac6420000000000848ae5",
      "text": "　　おい美樹さやか、そこ代われ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576772,
      "updated": 1789576778
    },
    {
      "id": "6aab16390000000000188451",
      "text": "　　叛逆に引き続きほむさやがアツい[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789597242,
      "updated": 1789597255
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac7250000000000848ae9",
      "text": "　名前と個性を持った魔女として転生することが[魔獣化]よりもマシな救済だという倫理のロジックがまだ理解できてない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789576998,
      "updated": 1789577367
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaac8240000000000848aea",
      "text": " 　ほとんどの人にとっては別に救済ではないよね",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789577254,
      "updated": 1789577540
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaabb6a0000000000c6f9a1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789573996,
      "updated": 1789573996
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaabb6c0000000000c6f9a2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789573997,
      "updated": 1789573997
    }
  ]
}